{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24643","headline":"夏日与闲禅师林下避暑 · 白居易","name":"夏日与闲禅师林下避暑","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洛景城西尘土红，伴僧闲坐竹泉东。\n绿萝潭上不见日，白石滩边长有风。\n热恼渐知随念尽，清凉常愿与人同。\n每因毒暑悲亲故，多在炎方瘴海中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24643.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24643","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}